     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">Good day,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">I&#39;m new to lavaan\r\nand am trying to do a SEM analysis using the code below but keep getting an error\r\nmessage. I appreciate it&#39;s a simple issue but my coding skills are basic and\r\nI&#39;ve been stuck at this for days. I need help to decipher what the\r\nproblem is so I can get on with my analysis.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">Model&lt;- &#39;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">PE=~ x1 + x2 + x3 +\r\nx4</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">EE=~ x5 + x6 + x7 +\r\nx8</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">SI=~ x9 + x10 + x11\r\n+ x12</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">FC=~ x13 + x14 + x15\r\n+ x16</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">BI ~ PE + EE + SI</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">UB~ BI + FC</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">&#39;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">fit &lt;-_sem\r\n(Model, data=survey2)</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt;color:red\">Error:\r\nunexpected input in &quot;fit &lt;-_&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">summary (fit,\r\nstandardized=TRUE)</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt;color:red\">Error in\r\nsummary(fit, standardized = TRUE) : object &#39;fit&#39; not found</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">Your help in solving\r\nthis is much appreciated. </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\"> </p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Many thanks,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\">Isaac</p></div>\r\n"
